WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
AI can build your application fast.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
But fast doesn't always mean ready.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Nettle scans your application for security, legal, compliance, and readiness gaps.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Instead of just finding problems, Nettle explains what's missing and why it matters.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Nettle recommends practical ways to fix the gap.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Fix it. Rescan it. Verify it.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Nettle compares the results and verifies your fixes.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.000
And keep monitoring as your application evolves.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.000
AI helps you build. Nettle helps you understand what was missed.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.880
Build fast. Know what you missed. Nettle — secure, compliant, ready.
